The visual mesh roqsim_sensors/models/realsense_d435/meshes/d435.obj is converted (COLLADA -> OBJ, joined and
decimated to ~4k triangles for real-time rendering) from d435.dae in:

    https://github.com/IntelRealSense/realsense-ros
    (realsense2_description/meshes/d435.dae)

