Every pose in roqsim_sensors/models/realsense_d435/realsense_d435.xml and in the `frames:` block of
realsense_d435.manifest.yaml -- the mesh in camera_link, the `d435_color` camera at the colour
optical frame, the depth frames, and the inertial module's gyro frame the `imu` component measures
at -- is read from the same repository's realsense2_description/urdf/_d435.urdf.xacro and
_d435i_imu_modules.urdf.xacro by external/convert/build_realsense_devices.py, not measured off the
mesh. The frame name the IMU is stamped in (camera_imu_optical_frame) is realsense2_camera's own,
from that package's include/constants.h.
